# 9. GitHub integration

Now connect your local PyCoin project to GitHub.

## 9.1 Configure Git identity

```bash
git config --global user.name "YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME"
git config --global user.email "YOUR_GITHUB_EMAIL"
```

## 9.2 Verify GitHub CLI authentication

```bash
gh auth status
```

If not authenticated:

```bash
gh auth login
```

Choose:

- GitHub.com
- HTTPS
- Authenticate using browser

## 9.3 Create the initial commit

```bash
cd ~/Projects/pycoin

git add .

git commit -m "Initialize PyCoin cryptocurrency project"
```

Rename the branch:

```bash
git branch -M main
```

## 9.4 Create GitHub repository

For a public educational repository:

```bash
gh repo create pycoin \
  --public \
  --source=. \
  --remote=origin \
  --push
```

If you prefer a private repository, replace `--public` with `--private`.

## 9.5 Verify remote and commit

```bash
git remote -v

git log -1 --oneline

git status
```

Expected:

```text
On branch main
nothing to commit, working tree clean
```

Your repository should now be available at:

`https://github.com/YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME/pycoin`

Do not manually create another GitHub repository if the `gh repo create` command has already succeeded.

---

# 10. Final Phase 0 acceptance checklist

Use this checklist before moving to Phase 1.

{@body const checks = ["Python virtual environment created","Backend dependencies installed","FastAPI application starts successfully","Health endpoint returns HTTP 200","Backend tests pass","Ruff lint passes","React application starts successfully","Frontend tests pass","React production build succeeds","CORS integration verified","README and architecture documentation created","LICENSE and .gitignore created","GitHub repository created","Initial commit pushed","Git working tree clean"]}
{@body const [done,setDone] = DIL.useState([])}
<box border radius="lg" padding={3} gap={3}>
  <row align=center justify=between>
    **Phase 0 completion**
    <title size="xl" color="default" tabularNums>{done.length}/{checks.length}</title>
  </row>
  <box background="surface-tertiary" height="8px" radius="full" clip>
    <box background="#16A34A" height="8px" radius="full" width={`${done.length/checks.length*100}%`}/>
  </box>
  {#each checks as item,i}
    <checkbox key={i} checked={done.includes(i)} onChange={v=>setDone(old=>v?[...old,i]:old.filter(x=>x!==i))}>{item}</checkbox>
  {/each}
  {#if done.length===checks.length}
    <badge color="success">All acceptance checks marked complete</badge>
    Update `documentation/PROJECT_STATUS.md` and commit the final Phase 0 status.
  {/if}
</box>

